   284	theta=0, to a bosonic square-free solution with the same body data. Sections3.1–3.3
   285	show a nonzero necessary rational compatibility residual for every n≥4, which cannot
   286	vanish on a nonempty open set of independent body parameters. Contradiction. The
   287	argument uses only the body component; no nilpotent correction can cancel it. ∎
   288	
   289	This answers a **Hietarinta-type generic interpretation, fixed in §1.2, of the
   290	explicitly proposed three-super-soliton test**. The paper itself does not specify
   291	the ansatz or quantifier. The result does **not** prove absence of infinitely many
   292	generalized symmetries, a Lax representation, constrained soliton families,
   293	nonstandard body ansätze, or isolated/reduced supersolutions. It is not a full
   294	refutation of every meaning of the 2018 integrability hypothesis or the book's
   295	broad construction conjecture.
